**Draft for legal review.**

## No cookies on the public site

West Mauritius does not set any cookies when you read the site, and we do not use advertising or tracking cookies. That is why you do not see a cookie banner.

- **Language:** your language is part of the address (/en or /fr); nothing is stored in your browser.
- **Visitor statistics:** Umami counts visits without cookies and without personal data.
- **Maps:** the maps load images from OpenFreeMap and do not set cookies.

## Admin area

Our editors who log in to the administration area receive one strictly necessary cookie that keeps them signed in for up to eight hours. It is never used for visitors.

## If this changes

If we ever add a service that needs cookies, we will ask for your permission first and update this page.
